   muPx = max(x, 0)

Similarly for y.

- Then compute weights w(i,j) = mu_i(x) * mu_j(y). There are 3x3=9 combos.

- Define array of output values c[i,j] (i index for error: N,Z,P; j index for derivative: N,Z,P). Use enumeration or numeric mapping.

Mapping:

i=0 (N), j=0 (N): -30
i=0, j=1 (Z): -20
i=0, j=2 (P): -10

